cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "AgenticMedicalImagingHelper"
abstract: >-
  A research and educational TypeScript CLI that orchestrates a multimodal
  model (Google Gemini by default, OpenRouter optionally) with LangGraph.js to
  analyse series of medical images and track how findings evolve across imaging
  sessions. It includes a deterministic fairness probe and an EU AI Act /
  NIST AI RMF governance matrix. Not a medical device; not clinically
  validated; outputs are experimental and are not clinical recommendations.
